Description: Querencia Desktop file manager (alpha)
 Querencia Files is the file manager of Querencia Desktop, a classic
 desktop in the style of GNOME 2. It is derived from the Strata file
 manager by LGSE Ltd. (MIT license) and adds a classic Nautilus 2 like
 look with the GNOME Human icon theme.
 .
 Querencia Files is MIT licensed and linked against the GPL library
 libpoppler-glib (PDF previews), so the binary as a whole is distributed
 under the terms of the GPL.
 .
 This package is built without RAR support (the UnRAR library has a
 non-free license). It does not register itself as the system-wide
 org.freedesktop.FileManager1 service or file chooser portal.
 .
 Querencia Desktop is developed with AI tools; every change is reviewed
 and accepted by the project owner.
 This is an alpha release.
